{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/884065-scarred-kingdoms-gothic-noirpunk-setting","id":884065,"title":"Scarred kingdoms, gothic-noirpunk setting.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-06T14:15:34-07:00","id":884065,"title":"Scarred kingdoms, gothic-noirpunk setting.","content":"I like to mix a lot of things to create new crazy mash-up for RPGs worlds, and one from my last ideas is mixing Ravenloft, World of Darkness, and Kult: lost divinity. I wanted a fantasy world to be used with the background and factions of World of Darkness, and Chronicles of Darkness. Let's say it is like mixing &quot;Song of Fire and Ice&quot; with &quot;American Horror Story&quot;.<br /> <br /> The world is a demiplane, a cosmic prison or cage, but prisoner and jailer are unknown. Ther &quot;archons&quot; are the &quot;gods&quot; of the religions from that world. In the past there were a cosmic war between the archons and the archons, the &quot;saviors&quot; of the humanity. The secret cults tell a different story: the titans were the old humanity with divine power, but they have fogoreten their previous lifes, living a illusion, but at least a faction (the fays and changelings) says really the archons are really the prisoners, and they have been fooled to believe they are the supreme lords.<br /> <br /> The level of technology is XX century but &quot;secret arcanpunk tech&quot; allow to create XXI tech like armours by graphene or robotic exosuits. The vampire masquerade is broken, but with shades. Population knows vampires were real in the past, at least there are legends about that, but today there were terminated, or at least not in this city, maybe somebody in the capital.<br /> <br /> Vampires have create a new race of slaves, the &quot;ganado&quot;, like living zombies whose blood can be drank. (Yes, something like the &quot;ganado&quot;, the infected creatures from Resident Evil 4).<br /> <br /> Awakaned magic isn't about Tinkerbell effect or paradigm, it can't be watched by sleepers because collective subconscious hate and fear magic, like a low-class worker hates and envy rich businessmen.<br /> <br /> The capital cities are &quot;archologies&quot;, super-buildings, with noir-punk but also &quot;vertical forests&quot;. Vampires rule archologies, or they think they are the true secret rulers.<br /> <br /> There were some &quot;robots&quot;, androids, but they aren't very popular because some urban legends tell about robots controlled by wraiths.<br /> <br /> They fays and archons don't like each other. Fays were with the titans' band in the past cosmic rebellion.<br /> <br /> There are &quot;bridges&quot; or &quot;stargates&quot; to &quot;another planets&quot;, but they are like John Carter's Mars, and Johan Norman's world of Gor (books)<br /> <br /> * This is only a skethc, and sorry because English isn't my naive languange.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":11152,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","user":"Luis Carlos","date":". 05-06-2016, 05:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}